on of the city is 9,182,100, and the urbanization rate of the resident population is 62.10%. Yongnian District in Handan and Shahe City in Xingtai have largely formed into a single conurbation.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/%E6%AD%A6%E7%81%B5%E4%B8%9B%E5%8F%B0_10.jpg/330px-%E6%AD%A6%E7%81%B5%E4%B8%9B%E5%8F%B0_10.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Handan"},"twins":["Q493794","Q617","Q157137","Q847546","Q48256"],"climate":{"temp":[-0.3,2.9,9.8,16.9,23.5,28.1,29.2,27.1,22.4,15.9,7.7,1],"rain":[5,10,9,31,49,62,157,128,70,26,18,5],"cloud":[54,56,52,59,62,68,70,64,61,50,46,47]},"land":true,"green":null,"transit":{"metroKm":0,"buswayKm":0,"bikeKm":10,"stations":0,"lines":0}}